  body
    h1 Welcome to the BlockchainUNN Content Bootcamp!

    p Hey #{firstName}!

    p We're thrilled to welcome you to the BlockchainUNN Content Bootcamp!

    p By signing up, you’ve taken the first step toward unlocking powerful skills in content creation within the blockchain and Web3 space.

    h2 What to Expect

    p Over the coming weeks, you’ll learn from content & marketing industry experts on how to craft engaging content that resonates in the fast-paced consumer-centric world.

    p From breaking down complex topics to creating viral content, we’re here to help you take your storytelling skills to the next level.

    h3 Here’s a quick look at what we’ll cover:

    ul
      li Content Strategy: Building a solid foundation for effective content in Web3.
      li Community Management: Learn how to engage communities that drive user growth.
      li Social Media in Web3: Tips on growing your audience and engaging with the crypto community.
      li Real-world Projects: Work on practical tasks that can serve as portfolio pieces!

    h3 Join Our WhatsApp Channel!
    p Follow the link here to stay updated: #[a(href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/LDgnFzCGYX7DAWFlk7ruW3") WhatsApp Channel]      

    h2 To make the most of this bootcamp, make sure you’re set up with:

    ul
      li A notepad or digital document for taking notes.
      li Any previous content you’ve worked on, so we can build from your experience.
      li An open mind—be ready to learn, share, and grow.

    h2 Don’t Forget

    p Be sure to add our bootcamp to your calendar! 
    p You won’t want to miss a single session. And if you know any friends or colleagues who’d benefit, feel free to share the registration link:

    p Stay tuned for our kickoff message with further details, and get excited for what’s ahead. 
    p We can’t wait to see the incredible content you’ll be creating soon!

    p Regards
    p The BlockchainUNN Team
